<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss revised Oct trade surplus 226.8 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Swiss revised Oct trade surplus 226.8 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland revised its October trade surplus down to 226.8 million Swiss francs from an originally reported 248.2 million, the Federal Customs Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>    SWISS TRADE	  Oct 96		Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>    Balance (million Sfr)  +226.8  (+248.2)   +115.1    +157.3</p>
<p>    Exports		8,690.0 (8,698.9) 7,856.2    8,206.1</p>
<p>    Imports		8,463.2 (8,450.7) 7,741.1    8,048.8</p>
<p>Note - preliminary October figures in brackets. All figures excluded precious metals, precious stones, art objects and antiques.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
